    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>  </strong></i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495060/extras/f824ba943c9194b35142407d171b0ba6.avif?t=1750547483\" width=616 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Punch and push your way up\u00a0and reach new heights as fast as possible!&quot;</strong><br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495060/extras/5bbe60ece8a5ff470fb876f013bfbce5.poster.avif?t=1750547483\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495060/extras/5bbe60ece8a5ff470fb876f013bfbce5.webm?t=1750547483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495060/extras/5bbe60ece8a5ff470fb876f013bfbce5.mp4?t=1750547483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>APEDROP</strong> is a retro-inspired action puzzle game in the style of Dr. Mario, Donkey Kong and Tetris. Punch, Jump, Push, Spin, Run and reach the top of the rankings!\u00a0   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495060/extras/fa96d568fc3d3a138c6e5193182d06ae.poster.avif?t=1750547483\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495060/extras/fa96d568fc3d3a138c6e5193182d06ae.webm?t=1750547483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495060/extras/fa96d568fc3d3a138c6e5193182d06ae.mp4?t=1750547483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Ranking system!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game controls customization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local</strong> player versus player.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Characters to choose from with more to come!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternative visuals!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495060/extras/18baacd0dae8052220c0138099560df6.poster.avif?t=1750547483\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495060/extras/18baacd0dae8052220c0138099560df6.webm?t=1750547483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495060/extras/18baacd0dae8052220c0138099560df6.mp4?t=1750547483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A note from Canary:<br><br><i>We hope that you have fun with this game! We had a blast creating it and this is our first step toward bigger things, thank you for your support!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>&quot;You inside the blocky arena&quot;</strong></i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>  </strong></i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495060/extras/f824ba943c9194b35142407d171b0ba6.avif?t=1750547483\" width=616 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Punch and push your way up\u00a0and reach new heights as fast as possible!&quot;</strong><br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495060/extras/5bbe60ece8a5ff470fb876f013bfbce5.poster.avif?t=1750547483\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495060/extras/5bbe60ece8a5ff470fb876f013bfbce5.webm?t=1750547483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495060/extras/5bbe60ece8a5ff470fb876f013bfbce5.mp4?t=1750547483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>APEDROP</strong> is a retro-inspired action puzzle game in the style of Dr. Mario, Donkey Kong and Tetris. Punch, Jump, Push, Spin, Run and reach the top of the rankings!\u00a0   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495060/extras/fa96d568fc3d3a138c6e5193182d06ae.poster.avif?t=1750547483\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495060/extras/fa96d568fc3d3a138c6e5193182d06ae.webm?t=1750547483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495060/extras/fa96d568fc3d3a138c6e5193182d06ae.mp4?t=1750547483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></